   "reason": "Clouded Judgement weekly medians: EV/NTM revenue for public cloud software fell to about 3x in spring 2026 and recovered to 4.4x by 4 Sep 2026 (top five at 31x). Over eight weekly prints the median rose from 3.5x to 4.4x, beyond the 0.3x dead band, so the direction reads concentrating (the market pricing more durable rents into the application layer). Capped at emerging because a single analyst's basket is tier 6 and there is no second source yet. Initial seed.",
